ssion of COL1A1, the growth factors FGF7 and CTGF, and the cell-cycle genes STMN1, KIAA0101, and MCM3 in humans. During early progenitor differentiation, FGF7 and COL1A1 expression increases and then declines as the cell commits to terminal fates.\")\n25612:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0020018 \"proliferative fibrochondrocyte\")\n25624:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0020019 \"regulatory chondrocyte\")\n25633:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0020020 \"homeostatic chondrocyte\")\n25645:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0020021 \"fibrochondrocyte progenitor cell\")\n25755:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_1000217 \"growth plate cartilage chondrocyte\")\n28939:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_1001607 \"articular chondrocyte\")\n29052:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_2000007 \"articular chondrocyte of knee joint\")\n35348:AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4072104 \"fibrochondrocyte\")\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
